# Stream keys
# -------------
# One key per platform. Mode 600. Do not commit.
#
# Copy to the repository root:
#     cp scripts/stream-keys.env.example stream-keys.env
#     chmod 600 stream-keys.env
#
# Kick, Instagram and TikTok keys expire. Copy them right before you go
# live, then re-run ./scripts/dry-run.sh to confirm.
#
# IMPORTANT -- ALWAYS QUOTE THE VALUES.
#
# The scripts source this file with `.` (shell source), so the values
# are parsed as shell. An Instagram key contains a query string with
# `&` characters, and an unquoted `&` backgrounds the command and
# silently drops the variable:
#
#     IG_KEY=1193042257001228?s_bl=1&s_fbp=dfw5-3     <-- BROKEN
#     IG_KEY="1193042257001228?s_bl=1&s_fbp=dfw5-3"   <-- correct
#
# A key that gets dropped this way looks like a MISSING key, not a
# quoting bug. Quote every value.

# --- YouTube (landscape) --------------------------------------------------
# YouTube Studio -> Create -> Go live -> Stream key.
# Shape: xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx (24 chars)
YT_LAND_KEY=""

# --- YouTube (portrait) ---------------------------------------------------
# A SECOND YouTube channel's key. YouTube gives one key per channel, so
# landscape and portrait need separate channels.
# Shape: xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx (24 chars)
YT_VERT_KEY=""

# --- Twitch ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Creator Dashboard -> Settings -> Stream -> Stream Key.
# Shape: live_<user_id>_<token> (44 chars)
# Multistreaming must be enabled on the account or Twitch will refuse
# the publish.
TWITCH_KEY=""

# --- Kick -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Channel -> Stream Settings -> Stream Key.
# Shape: sk_<region>_<token> (56 chars)
KICK_KEY=""

# --- Instagram ------------------------------------------------------------
# Instagram -> Go live -> Software -> copy the server URL and key.
# The whole 124-char string is the key. Session-scoped, ~1 hour.
# The base host is edgetee-upload-<region>-1.xx.fbcdn.net
# This one NEEDS quotes -- it contains & characters.
IG_KEY=""
IG_URL="rtmps://edgetee-upload-den2-1.xx.fbcdn.net:443/rtmp/"

# --- TikTok ---------------------------------------------------------------
# TikTok LIVE studio -> Go live -> Stream -> Software -> copy both.
# Set "Optimise for" to Software BEFORE copying the key.
# Session-scoped, ~1 hour.
TIKTOK_KEY=""
TIKTOK_URL="rtmps://live.tiktokcdn.com/live"

# --- Options --------------------------------------------------------------
# Platforms to skip in the dry run. Space-separated.
# A skipped platform never disqualifies the run.
# SKIP_PLATFORMS="TikTok Instagram"
